{"assumptions":["Greenfield build: every requirement is ADDED with no code anchors.","All business rules live in one booking service module (ASM-6) with public operations such as book, joinWaitlist, cancel, leaveWaitlist, undoBooking, getSchedule/filterSessions, getBookings/getMyBookings, getStats, getActionState, a today value and the test-only simulateOtherMemberCancellation hook, with an injectable clock and storage; every screen action goes through this module.","Booking window boundaries: a session starting exactly 168 hours from now is bookable; exactly 15 minutes before start is bookable, 14 minutes is not (Q-4). Both the 7-day and the 15-minute rule reject with the same \"outside booking window\" error (REQ-10, REQ-11).","Free cancellation applies when the start is at least 2 hours away (exactly 120 minutes is free); less than 2 hours is a late cancellation.","When Alex cancels a Booked session with an empty waitlist the booked count drops by 1; with a waitlist the booked count stays the same and the waitlist count drops by 1 (Q-5).","Joining a waitlist is rejected while spots are free; intensity is multi-select like class type.","Leaving a waitlist stores a Cancelled record with the late flag false, which appears in the Past list with a \"Cancelled\" badge (REQ-19, REQ-28).","A Booked class stays in the Upcoming list while it is in progress and moves to Past as Attended only once it has ended (REQ-26, REQ-28).","Filters combine as OR within a group and AND across groups; Morning is before 12:00, Afternoon 12:00–16:59, Evening 17:00 onward (ASM-10).","Classes this month counts only Attended records; Current streak counts consecutive Monday–Sunday weeks with at least one Attended record, counting back from the current week, or from the previous week if the current week has none yet; late cancellations change no stat (request §13, Q-7).","Waitlist promotion is announced in-app with a toast the next time the app opens, shown once (request §13).","Disabled-footer reason texts are 'Class has started', 'Cancelled by studio' and 'Booking opens 7 days before class' / 'Booking closes 15 minutes before class'.","Because Alex is never seeded onto a studio-cancelled class and there is no staff UI, a booked class cannot become studio-cancelled in this release; if it ever did, it would show in Past as 'Cancelled by studio' (ASM-8, ASM-19).","Seeded past Attended bookings for Alex may point to sessions dated before the current week so history exists whatever day the app first loads; these sessions don't appear on the Schedule. Seeded bookings skip the booking-window checks.","A Waitlisted entry whose class has ended leaves Upcoming and is not shown in Past.","The quick Cancel action on My Bookings opens the same confirmation dialog as Class Detail.","The tablet layout is 768–1023 px and the desktop side-panel layout starts at 1024 px.","The static app is hosted in one cloud region in the client's cloud account (ASM-13).","Stored seed data is rolled forward rather than replaced: on each load, any missing current or next Monday–Sunday week gets newly generated sessions (at least 20 per week, all 5 types, including full, almost-full and studio-cancelled examples where possible) with no booking records for Alex; existing sessions, bookings and counts are never changed (Q-6, REQ-62).","When Alex is skipped at waitlist position 1 and nobody else is waiting, the freed spot stays open and Alex remains Waitlisted #1 with the stored reason; a book call still returns 'already booked', Alex may leave the waitlist and then book normally, and the next promotion hook run re-checks Alex's eligibility (ASM-14, REQ-22, REQ-31).","Cancel and leave-waitlist check the record's current status before any other rule, so a repeated or mismatched request (e.g. a double-tapped Cancel) gets the \"invalid booking state\" error and never changes counts twice (REQ-63)."],"critic":[{"finding":"REQ-28 defines the Past list as only \"Attended and Cancelled records\", but REQ-27 and REQ-49 also put \"Cancelled by studio\" records in Past, so the list definitions contradict each other.","reqId":"REQ-28","rubric":1,"severity":"medium"},{"finding":"\"Upcoming\" means different things: REQ-16 counts the 10-booking limit on sessions that \"have not started\", while REQ-28 and the REQ-30 Upcoming stat use sessions that \"have not ended\", so an in-progress class counts toward the stat but not the limit.","reqId":"REQ-16","rubric":1,"severity":"medium"},{"finding":"Every Upcoming row must show a Cancel or Leave action, and REQ-28 keeps in-progress classes in Upcoming, but REQ-13 rejects cancel and leave once a class has started; no disabled state is defined for these rows.","reqId":"REQ-49","rubric":2,"severity":"medium"},{"finding":"The order of action states is undefined when Alex is Booked or Waitlisted on a session that has started (or is studio-cancelled): REQ-31 and REQ-46 allow both Booked/\"Cancel booking\" and Disabled \"started\".","reqId":"REQ-31","rubric":1,"severity":"medium"},{"finding":"No order of precedence is set between book errors (already booked, class full, outside booking window, class has started, cancelled by studio, overlap, limit), so a session that breaks several rules (e.g. full and studio-cancelled) has no single defined error, even though each AC asserts an exact error.","reqId":"REQ-6","rubric":1,"severity":"medium"},{"finding":"undoBooking has no error paths: undo after 5 seconds, undo on a non-Booked or already-undone record, or a second undo call are all unspecified, and REQ-63's \"invalid booking state\" guard covers only cancel and leave.","reqId":"REQ-25","rubric":2,"severity":"medium"},{"finding":"Undo \"restore[s] the session's booked count to its value before the booking\" (an absolute value), which overwrites any count change made in between (e.g. by the promotion hook) instead of subtracting 1.","reqId":"REQ-25","rubric":6,"severity":"low"},{"finding":"AC-24.1 and AC-23.1 are manual checks that need simulateOtherMemberCancellation to have run, but ASM-16 makes that hook test-only with no UI, so a manual tester cannot reach this state from any public surface.","reqId":"REQ-24","rubric":3,"severity":"medium"},{"finding":"The \"promoted since the last visit, shown once\" toast needs stored state (a last-visit or notification-seen marker), but REQ-5 lists the persisted fields without it and no requirement defines when it is set or cleared.","reqId":"REQ-24","rubric":6,"severity":"medium"},{"finding":"The stored skip reason is only re-checked when the hook runs again, so after Alex cancels the overlapping class, Class Detail (REQ-23) and getActionState keep showing an out-of-date \"overlaps Power HIIT\" reason.","reqId":"REQ-22","rubric":6,"severity":"low"},{"finding":"The skip path leaves a session that has free spots but a non-zero waitlist count (AC-22.4: booked 15 of 16, waitlist 1), which contradicts REQ-9's premise that a waitlist only exists while the session is full, and REQ-32 then labels it \"1 spot left\".","reqId":"REQ-22","rubric":6,"severity":"low"},{"finding":"A cancellation inside 15 minutes of start always promotes another waitlisted member (waitlist count -1), but ASM-2 and REQ-22 say nobody can be promoted within the 15-minute window.","reqId":"REQ-18","rubric":1,"severity":"low"},{"finding":"AC-48.1 needs the session to \"become full in stored data\" while Class Detail is open, which is impossible to reach with one member and no backend; multi-tab local storage concurrency, the only realistic cause, is never specified.","reqId":"REQ-48","rubric":3,"severity":"low"},{"finding":"The only recovery from failing to read stored data is Retry, so corrupt or schema-incompatible local storage, or storage that is unavailable on first load, leaves the app permanently on an error with no reset or re-seed path.","reqId":"REQ-43","rubric":2,"severity":"medium"},{"finding":"Nothing says what activating the \"Booked ✓\" or \"Waitlisted #N\" card button does (cancel, open detail, or nothing), yet AC-7.3 relies on a second tap landing on that button.","reqId":"REQ-38","rubric":2,"severity":"medium"},{"finding":"AC-3.3 does not check that seeded records match the session counts: that the Waitlisted session is full with position ≤ its waitlist count, and that the two Booked sessions don't overlap and are included in booked counts.","reqId":"REQ-3","rubric":6,"severity":"low"},{"finding":"REQ-4 says stored sessions are reused unchanged whenever stored seed data exists, while REQ-62 adds newly generated weeks to the same store on load, so the two load-time behaviours are stated inconsistently.","reqId":"REQ-4","rubric":1,"severity":"low"},{"finding":"Rolling seed data forward week by week goes beyond Q-6 (\"worked out from today on first load, then stored\") and I-5 (current and next week).","reqId":"REQ-62","rubric":4,"severity":"low"},{"finding":"Generated weeks such as 19–25 Oct 2026 include the Europe/London DST change, but nothing says whether session start times are produced as London wall-clock times or as fixed offsets.","reqId":"REQ-62","rubric":6,"severity":"low"},{"finding":"The studio's rule thresholds (10-booking limit, 7-day, 15-minute and 2-hour windows) are written directly into user-facing strings and logic (\"You've reached the limit of 10 upcoming classes.\", \"Booking opens 7 days before class\") rather than set as studio configuration; Q-10 covered only REQ-33 and 1023 px.","reqId":"REQ-16","rubric":8,"severity":"low"},{"finding":"Assumptions and out-of-scope items cite \"request §12\" and \"request §13\" (e.g. the promotion toast, the streak definition), but no such sections appear among the intent spans, so these claims have no source.","reqId":"REQ-24","rubric":5,"severity":"low"},{"finding":"AC-60.1 requires a passing test for each of \"the 8 named business rules\", but the requirement lists 8 to 10 rules depending on whether 7-day/15-minute and past/studio-cancelled count as one each, so the check is ambiguous.","reqId":"REQ-60","rubric":3,"severity":"low"},{"finding":"Class Detail has no not-found or invalid-session path (e.g. a stale or unknown session ID from navigation or reload), and reloading or using the browser Back button on Class Detail is not specified.","reqId":"REQ-39","rubric":2,"severity":"low"},{"finding":"A 5-participant usability study with a median 30-second time-to-book is not in the intent and adds a human-research activity beyond the requested automated tests.","reqId":"NFR-10","rubric":4,"severity":"low"}],"lint":[{"check":"L1 ids","details":"ok","passed":true},{"check":"L2 req-ac","details":"ok","passed":true},{"check":"L3 ears","details":"ok","passed":true},{"check":"L4 vague","details":"ok","passed":true},{"check":"L5 nfr","details":"ok","passed":true},{"check":"L6 scope","details":"ok","passed":true},{"check":"L8 anchors","details":"ok","passed":true},{"check":"L9 size","details":"This spec has 60 requirements, about 5 runs' worth of work for a feature; approve it as one run or reject with which part to cut.","passed":false},{"check":"L10 trace","details":"ok","passed":true},{"check":"L11 observable","details":"ok","passed":true},{"check":"L12 literals","details":"REQ-33 hardcodes \"REQ-32\"; should it be configuration?; REQ-58 hardcodes \"1023\"; should it be configuration?","passed":false}],"nfrs":[{"id":"NFR-1","metric":"Time from day-chip activation to cards displayed < 1000 ms at the 95th percentile over 10 runs","text":"The Schedule for a selected day renders with seed data on a mid-range phone profile (Moto G Power–class device or Chrome DevTools 4× CPU throttle)."},{"id":"NFR-2","metric":"Button/card state change displayed ≤ 100 ms after activation, p95 over 20 actions (Performance trace)","text":"Book, cancel, join and leave actions give visual feedback optimistically."},{"id":"NFR-3","metric":"Contrast ≥ 4.5:1 for normal text and ≥ 3:1 for large text and UI components; 0 violations in an automated axe scan of all 3 screens in both themes and on 100% of token pairs checked","text":"All text and UI component colour pairs meet WCAG 2.1 AA contrast in light and dark themes."},{"id":"NFR-4","metric":"100% of interactive elements ≥ 44 × 44 CSS px at a 360 px viewport","text":"Interactive targets are large enough for touch use."},{"id":"NFR-5","metric":"With prefers-reduced-motion: reduce, 0 transitions or animations longer than 0 ms on card press, sheet/panel slide, capacity bar fill and toast","text":"Motion respects the reduced-motion preference."},{"id":"NFR-6","metric":"0 horizontal page scroll at viewport widths 360, 375, 768, 1024 and 1440 px on all three screens","text":"No horizontal page scrolling on supported widths."},{"id":"NFR-7","metric":"0 duplicate booking records after 10 rapid taps on Book for one session","text":"Repeated taps on Book never create duplicate bookings."},{"id":"NFR-8","metric":"0 occurrences of stack traces or raw exception text on any screen across the full test suite, including forced storage failures","text":"Users never see raw errors."},{"id":"NFR-9","metric":"End-to-end test and acceptance criteria pass on the latest 2 versions of Chrome, Edge, Safari and Firefox (8 browser versions)","text":"Browser support (ASM-12)."},{"id":"NFR-10","metric":"Median time from app open to booking confirmation ≤ 30 s across 5 first-time test participants","text":"Members can find and book a class within 30 seconds of opening the app."},{"id":"NFR-11","metric":"Deployed to exactly 1 cloud region","text":"The static app is hosted in the client's cloud account (ASM-13)."},{"id":"NFR-12","metric":"0 outbound network requests containing booking or member data during the end-to-end test run","text":"Member and booking data (PII) stays in the browser."}],"outOfScope":["Sign in, sign up and password reset; a single pre-signed-in demo member (request §12)","Payments, credits, class packs and membership purchase (request §12)","Staff, instructor or admin screens, schedule editing, and any operation for the studio to cancel a class, including one Alex holds (request §12, ASM-8)","Email, SMS and push notifications (request §12)","Calendar export or sync (request §12)","Multiple studio locations (request §12)","Native mobile apps (request §12)","Multi-language support (request §12)","A backend server or database: persistence is browser local storage only (ASM-15, ASM-6)","Any visible UI for the waitlist promotion demo hook; it is test-only (ASM-16)","Modelling other members as individual records; they exist only as booked and waitlist counts (Q-5)","Schedule navigation beyond the current and next week (ASM-9, ASM-20)"],"requirements":[{"acceptance":[{"given":"A fresh browser with no stored app data","id":"AC-1.1","level":"manual","then":"The Schedule screen is shown, the top bar displays the text \"Pulse Studio\" and an avatar with the text \"AR\", and no sign-in page is shown","when":"The app root URL is opened"},{"given":"The Schedule screen is shown","id":"AC-1.2","level":"manual","then":"The My Bookings screen is shown with the name \"Alex Rivera\" and the membership \"Unlimited Monthly\"","when":"The \"AR\" avatar is activated"},{"given":"The Schedule screen is shown at a 360 px wide viewport","id":"AC-1.3","level":"manual","then":"Exactly five type chips are displayed, labelled \"Yoga\", \"Pilates\", \"HIIT\", \"Spin\" and \"Boxing\", and no other studio location is shown anywhere on the page","when":"A person looks at the class type filter chips"}],"ears":"The booking app shall be a responsive web app for the single-location boutique studio Pulse Studio offering Yoga, Pilates, HIIT, Spin and Boxing classes, presenting exactly three screens, Schedule (the home screen at the root URL), Class Detail and My Bookings, for the single pre-signed-in member Alex Rivera with no sign-in screen, under a top bar that shows the \"Pulse Studio\" wordmark and the member avatar with initials \"AR\" linking to My Bookings.","id":"REQ-1","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1","I-3"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A clock of 2026-10-06T23:30Z (00:30 on 7 October in Europe/London)","id":"AC-2.1","level":"unit","then":"The returned date is 2026-10-07","when":"The booking service's today value is read"},{"given":"A session starting at 2026-10-07T17:30Z","id":"AC-2.2","level":"unit","then":"The returned text is \"18:30\"","when":"The time formatter is called for it"},{"given":"A class starting at 18:30 London time","id":"AC-2.3","level":"manual","then":"The card displays \"18:30\"","when":"A person views its card on a device set to a US timezone and 12-hour clock"}],"ears":"The booking app shall work out \"today\", day boundaries and every time-based rule in the Europe/London timezone and show all times in 24-hour HH:mm format.","id":"REQ-2","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1","I-2","I-4","Q-4"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A fixed clock of Wednesday 2026-10-07 10:00 Europe/London","id":"AC-3.1","level":"unit","then":"The returned session list has a count of at least 40, includes every one of the 5 class types and 3 rooms, and the returned instructor list has a count of 5, each with a name, a bio and an avatar","when":"The seed generator is called"},{"given":"The same returned seed data","id":"AC-3.2","level":"unit","then":"The count of sessions with booked count equal to capacity is at least 3, the count with 1–3 free spots is at least 3, and the count with status \"Cancelled by studio\" is at least 1","when":"Sessions are counted by availability"},{"given":"The same returned seed data","id":"AC-3.3","level":"unit","then":"Exactly 2 records are Booked on sessions starting after now, 1 record is Waitlisted with a waitlist position value, 3 records are Attended on sessions that ended before now, and no record refers to a session with status \"Cancelled by studio\"","when":"Alex Rivera's booking records are read"},{"given":"The same returned seed data","id":"AC-3.4","level":"unit","then":"Every session record has a name, type, intensity of Low/Medium/High, instructor, room, start date-time, a duration value of 30, 45, 60 or 75, capacity, booked count, waitlist count, a 2–4 sentence description, a non-empty what-to-bring list and a status","when":"Each session's fields are read"}],"ears":"When the seed generator runs, the booking service shall return seed data containing at least 40 class sessions across the types Yoga, Pilates, HIIT, Spin and Boxing and the rooms Studio A, Studio B and Spin Room, 5 instructors with name, bio and avatar, at least 3 full sessions, at least 3 sessions with 1–3 spots left, at least 1 session with status \"Cancelled by studio\", and for demo member Alex Rivera 2 upcoming Booked bookings, 1 Waitlisted booking and 3 past Attended bookings, none of them on a studio-cancelled session.","id":"REQ-3","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","ASM-8"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Empty local storage and a fixed clock of Wednesday 2026-10-07 10:00 Europe/London","id":"AC-4.1","level":"unit","then":"Every returned schedule session start date falls between Monday 2026-10-05 00:00 and Sunday 2026-10-18 23:59 Europe/London (sessions referenced only by Alex's past Attended bookings may be earlier), and local storage holds a stored record of the sessions","when":"The booking service is initialised"},{"given":"Local storage already holds data seeded on 2026-10-07","id":"AC-4.2","level":"unit","then":"The returned sessions have the same IDs and start times as the stored data","when":"The booking service is initialised with a clock of 2026-10-09"}],"ears":"When the app loads, the booking service shall generate the seed sessions dated within the current Monday–Sunday week and the next week, both measured from the load date in Europe/London, and store them in browser local storage if no stored data exists, or reuse the stored sessions with their IDs and start times unchanged if stored seed data already exists.","id":"REQ-4","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","I-6","Q-6","ASM-5","ASM-20"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"One booking service instance has booked one class, cancelled another late and joined a waitlist at position 3 over a given local storage","id":"AC-5.1","level":"unit","then":"The returned lists contain the same 3 records with the same status, late flag and waitlist position values, and the returned session count values match","when":"A new instance is created over the same storage and the bookings are read"},{"given":"Alex has booked a class through the Schedule screen","id":"AC-5.2","level":"manual","then":"The class card button is shown as \"Booked ✓\" and the class is listed under Upcoming in My Bookings with a \"Booked\" badge","when":"The page is reloaded"}],"ears":"When any booking action changes data, the booking service shall write bookings, statuses, late flags, session counts and waitlist positions to browser local storage before reporting success, so a new instance over the same storage, or a page reload, returns the same data.","id":"REQ-5","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-6","ASM-6","ASM-15"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Session \"Sunrise Vinyasa\" with capacity 20, booked count 18, starting in 2 days, with no conflicts","id":"AC-6.1","level":"unit","then":"The returned record has status Booked, a booking ID and a created date-time, and the session's returned booked count value is 19","when":"book(session) is called"},{"given":"The booking from AC-6.1 has been made","id":"AC-6.2","level":"unit","then":"The returned Upcoming list contains the Sunrise Vinyasa record with status Booked","when":"The bookings are read"}],"ears":"When Alex books a Scheduled session that has free spots, starts within the booking window, does not overlap another Booked session of Alex's and keeps Alex at or under 10 upcoming Booked sessions, the booking service shall create one Booked record with an ID and created date-time and increase the session's booked count by 1.","id":"REQ-6","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-4","ASM-6"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A session with capacity 20 and booked count 10","id":"AC-7.1","level":"unit","then":"The second call returns an \"already booked\" error, the returned booking list has exactly 1 record for the session, and the booked count value is 11","when":"book(S) is called twice in a row with no wait between them"},{"given":"Alex is Waitlisted on a full session","id":"AC-7.2","level":"unit","then":"The returned error is \"already booked\" and the waitlist count value is unchanged","when":"joinWaitlist is called again for that session"},{"given":"The Schedule screen shows a bookable class","id":"AC-7.3","level":"manual","then":"My Bookings shows exactly one row for that class","when":"A person taps its Book button twice within 300 ms"}],"ears":"If Alex already holds a Booked or Waitlisted record for a session, then the booking service shall reject a further book or join-waitlist request for that session with an \"already booked\" error without creating a record or changing counts.","id":"REQ-7","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-4"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Session \"Power HIIT\" with capacity 16 and booked count 16","id":"AC-8.1","level":"unit","then":"The returned error is \"class full\", no Booked record is created, and the booked count value stays 16","when":"book(session) is called"}],"ears":"If a session's booked count equals its capacity, then the booking service shall reject a book request with a \"class full\" error and leave the booked and waitlist counts unchanged.","id":"REQ-8","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-4"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Session \"Power HIIT\" is full with waitlist count 2 and starts tomorrow","id":"AC-9.1","level":"unit","then":"The returned record has status Waitlisted with position value 3, and the session's waitlist count value is 3","when":"joinWaitlist(session) is called"},{"given":"A full session that overlaps a session Alex has Booked, and Alex holds 10 upcoming Booked sessions","id":"AC-9.2","level":"unit","then":"The returned record has status Waitlisted with a position value and no error is returned","when":"joinWaitlist(session) is called"},{"given":"A session with free spots","id":"AC-9.3","level":"unit","then":"A not-full (spots available) error is returned, no record is created and the waitlist count value is unchanged","when":"joinWaitlist(session) is called"}],"ears":"When Alex requests to join the waitlist of a Scheduled session that starts within the booking window, the booking service shall either create a Waitlisted record whose position equals the previous waitlist count plus 1 and increase the waitlist count by 1, without checking the overlap rule or the 10-booking limit, when the session is full, or reject the request with a not-full error when the session has free spots.","id":"REQ-9","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-4","Q-2"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Sessions with free spots starting exactly 168 hours, 167 hours 59 minutes, and 168 hours plus 1 minute after now","id":"AC-10.1","level":"unit","then":"The first two calls return a Booked record and the third returns the \"outside booking window\" error with the booked count value unchanged","when":"book is called for each"},{"given":"A full session starting 168 hours and 1 minute after now","id":"AC-10.2","level":"unit","then":"The returned error is \"outside booking window\", no record is created and the waitlist count value is unchanged","when":"joinWaitlist is called"}],"ears":"If a session starts more than 7×24 hours after now, then the booking service shall reject book and join-waitlist requests with an \"outside booking window\" error, while a session starting exactly 168 hours after now is bookable.","id":"REQ-10","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-4","Q-2","Q-4"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Sessions starting exactly 15 minutes and 14 minutes after now, each with free spots","id":"AC-11.1","level":"unit","then":"The first call returns a Booked record and the second returns the \"outside booking window\" error with no record created","when":"book is called for each"},{"given":"A full session starting in 10 minutes","id":"AC-11.2","level":"unit","then":"The returned error is \"outside booking window\" and the waitlist count value is unchanged","when":"joinWaitlist is called"}],"ears":"If a session that has not started starts less than 15 minutes after now, then the booking service shall reject book and join-waitlist requests with the \"outside booking window\" error, while a session starting exactly 15 minutes after now is bookable.","id":"REQ-11","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-4","Q-2","Q-4"],"stability":0.6666666666666666},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A session that started 1 minute ago with free spots","id":"AC-13.1","level":"unit","then":"The returned error is \"class has started\" and no record is created","when":"book(session) is called"},{"given":"Alex holds a Booked record on a session that started 10 minutes ago and has not ended","id":"AC-13.2","level":"unit","then":"The returned error is \"class has started\" and the record status value stays Booked","when":"cancel(booking) is called"},{"given":"A full session that started 5 minutes ago","id":"AC-13.3","level":"unit","then":"The returned error is \"class has started\" and the waitlist count value is unchanged","when":"joinWaitlist(session) is called"},{"given":"Alex is Waitlisted on a session that started 5 minutes ago","id":"AC-13.4","level":"unit","then":"The returned error is \"class has started\" and the record status value stays Waitlisted","when":"leaveWaitlist(booking) is called"}],"ears":"If a session's start time is at or before now, then the booking service shall reject book, join-waitlist, cancel and leave-waitlist requests for it with a \"class has started\" error and leave all bookings and counts unchanged.","id":"REQ-13","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-4","Q-2"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A session with status \"Cancelled by studio\", capacity 20, booked count 0, starting tomorrow","id":"AC-14.1","level":"unit","then":"The returned error is \"cancelled by studio\" and no record is created","when":"book(session) is called"},{"given":"A full session with status \"Cancelled by studio\"","id":"AC-14.2","level":"unit","then":"The returned error is \"cancelled by studio\" and the waitlist count value is unchanged","when":"joinWaitlist(session) is called"}],"ears":"If a session has status \"Cancelled by studio\", then the booking service shall reject book and join-waitlist requests for it with a \"cancelled by studio\" error.","id":"REQ-14","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-4","Q-2"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Alex is Booked for \"Power HIIT\" 18:00–18:45 on a day","id":"AC-15.1","level":"unit","then":"The returned error message is \"You're already booked for Power HIIT at 18:00–18:45.\" and no record is created","when":"book is called for an 18:30 Spin session the same day"},{"given":"Alex is Booked for \"Power HIIT\" 18:00–18:45 on a day","id":"AC-15.2","level":"unit","then":"The returned record has status Booked","when":"book is called for a session starting at 18:45 the same day"}],"ears":"If a book request would give Alex two Booked sessions whose time ranges overlap, then the booking service shall reject it with the error message \"You're already booked for <class name> at <start>–<end>.\", while sessions that only touch end-to-start are not treated as overlapping.","id":"REQ-15","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-4","ASM-7","ASM-18"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Alex holds 10 upcoming Booked sessions","id":"AC-16.1","level":"unit","then":"The returned error message is \"You've reached the limit of 10 upcoming classes.\" and the count of Alex's Booked records stays 10","when":"book is called for an 11th bookable session"},{"given":"Alex holds 9 upcoming Booked sessions and 3 Waitlisted sessions","id":"AC-16.2","level":"unit","then":"The returned record has status Booked","when":"book is called for a bookable session"}],"ears":"If Alex already holds 10 Booked records on sessions that have not started, then the booking service shall reject a further book request with the error \"You've reached the limit of 10 upcoming classes.\", where Waitlisted records do not count toward the limit.","id":"REQ-16","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-4"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Booked record on a session starting in 90 minutes","id":"AC-17.1","level":"unit","then":"The returned record has status Cancelled and late flag value true","when":"cancel(booking) is called"},{"given":"A Booked record on a session starting in exactly 120 minutes","id":"AC-17.2","level":"unit","then":"The returned record has status Cancelled and late flag value false","when":"cancel(booking) is called"},{"given":"A Booked record on a session starting in 1 hour 59 minutes","id":"AC-17.3","level":"unit","then":"The returned value is true, and for a session starting in exactly 2 hours the returned value is false","when":"isLateCancellation(booking) is called"}],"ears":"When Alex cancels a Booked record for a session that has not started, the booking service shall set the record status to Cancelled with a late flag that is true only when the session starts less than 2 hours later.","id":"REQ-17","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-4","Q-7","ASM-3"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Booked record on a session with capacity 16, booked count 16 and waitlist count 2","id":"AC-18.1","level":"unit","then":"The booked count value stays 16 and the waitlist count value is 1","when":"cancel(booking) is called"},{"given":"A Booked record on a session with booked count 10 and waitlist count 0","id":"AC-18.2","level":"unit","then":"The returned booked count value is 9 and the waitlist count value is 0","when":"cancel(booking) is called"}],"ears":"When Alex cancels a Booked record (free or late), the booking service shall reduce the session's waitlist count by 1 and keep the booked count unchanged if the waitlist count is above 0, and otherwise reduce the booked count by 1.","id":"REQ-18","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-4","Q-5"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Alex is Waitlisted at position 3 on a session with waitlist count 3 starting tomorrow","id":"AC-19.1","level":"unit","then":"The returned record has status Cancelled and late flag false, the session's waitlist count value is 2, and the returned Upcoming list no longer contains the session","when":"leaveWaitlist(booking) is called"}],"ears":"When Alex leaves a waitlist for a session that has not started, the booking service shall set the Waitlisted record status to Cancelled with the late flag false, remove it from the Upcoming list, and reduce the session's waitlist count by 1.","id":"REQ-19","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2"],"stability":0.6666666666666666},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A full session with capacity 16, booked count 16, waitlist count 3, and Alex Waitlisted at position 1 with no overlap and fewer than 10 Booked sessions","id":"AC-21.1","level":"unit","then":"Alex's returned record has status Booked with no waitlist position value, the booked count value stays 16 and the waitlist count value is 2","when":"simulateOtherMemberCancellation(session) is called"},{"given":"A full session with waitlist count 4 and Alex Waitlisted at position 3","id":"AC-21.2","level":"unit","then":"Alex's returned record is Waitlisted with position value 2, the waitlist count value is 3 and the booked count value is unchanged","when":"simulateOtherMemberCancellation(session) is called"},{"given":"A full session with booked count 16 and waitlist count 0","id":"AC-21.3","level":"unit","then":"The returned booked count value is 15","when":"simulateOtherMemberCancellation(session) is called"}],"ears":"When the test-only hook simulateOtherMemberCancellation(session) runs, the booking service shall promote the first waitlisted member: if Alex is at position 1 and eligible, change Alex's record to Booked with no waitlist position; if Alex is at a position above 1, reduce Alex's position by 1; and reduce the waitlist count by 1 with the booked count unchanged, or reduce the booked count by 1 when the waitlist is empty.","id":"REQ-21","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-4","Q-5","ASM-16"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Alex is Waitlisted at position 1 on a full Spin session 18:30–19:15 with waitlist count 3 and is Booked on \"Power HIIT\" 18:00–18:45 the same day","id":"AC-22.1","level":"unit","then":"Alex's returned record has status Waitlisted, position value 1 and a reason field naming \"Power HIIT\", the waitlist count value is 2 and the booked count value is unchanged","when":"simulateOtherMemberCancellation(session) is called"},{"given":"Alex is Waitlisted at position 1 on a full session with waitlist count 2 and holds 10 upcoming Booked sessions","id":"AC-22.2","level":"unit","then":"Alex's returned record stays Waitlisted at position 1 with a reason field value stating the 10-class limit","when":"simulateOtherMemberCancellation(session) is called"},{"given":"Alex is Waitlisted at position 1 on a full session starting in 10 minutes","id":"AC-22.3","level":"unit","then":"Alex's returned record stays Waitlisted at position 1 and the returned reason value is outside-booking-window","when":"simulateOtherMemberCancellation(session) is called"},{"given":"Alex is Waitlisted at position 1 on a full session with capacity 16, waitlist count 1, and holds an overlapping Booked class","id":"AC-22.4","level":"unit","then":"Alex's returned record stays Waitlisted at position 1, the waitlist count value is 1, the booked count value is 15, and the returned action state is Waitlisted with position value 1 and the overlap reason","when":"simulateOtherMemberCancellation(session) is called and then getActionState(session) is called"},{"given":"The state after AC-22.4, and Alex has then cancelled the overlapping Booked class","id":"AC-22.5","level":"unit","then":"Alex's returned record has status Booked with no waitlist position value, the waitlist count value is 0 and the booked count value stays 15","when":"simulateOtherMemberCancellation(session) is called again"}],"ears":"If promoting Alex from waitlist position 1 would overlap another Booked session of Alex's, take Alex above 10 upcoming Booked sessions, or the session starts less than 15 minutes after now, then the booking service shall keep Alex Waitlisted at position 1, store and return the reason Alex was skipped, and either promote the next member by reducing the waitlist count by 1 or, when Alex is the only member waiting, reduce the booked count by 1 and re-check Alex's eligibility on the next promotion hook run.","id":"REQ-22","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-4","ASM-2","ASM-14"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"The promotion hook kept Alex Waitlisted #1 on a Spin session because of an overlap with \"Power HIIT\"","id":"AC-23.1","level":"manual","then":"The footer displays \"You're #1 on the waitlist\" and next to it a reason message naming Power HIIT","when":"The Class Detail screen for that session is opened"}],"ears":"If the promotion hook kept Alex waitlisted because of overlap, the 10-booking limit or the 15-minute window, then the Class Detail screen shall show the stored reason next to Alex's waitlist position.","id":"REQ-23","op":"ADDED","sources":["ASM-14"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"simulateOtherMemberCancellation promoted Alex on \"Power HIIT\" while the app was closed","id":"AC-24.1","level":"manual","then":"A toast message containing \"Power HIIT\" is displayed once and is not shown again on the next reload","when":"The app is opened"}],"ears":"When the app opens after Alex was promoted from a waitlist to Booked since the last visit, the booking app shall show a toast naming the class Alex is now booked for, once.","id":"REQ-24","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-4"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Alex has just booked a session starting in 30 minutes (inside the 2-hour window), raising its booked count from 18 to 19","id":"AC-25.1","level":"unit","then":"The returned booking list has no record for the session (no Booked and no Cancelled record) and the booked count value is 18","when":"undoBooking(booking) is called"},{"given":"Alex booked a class from a Schedule card","id":"AC-25.2","level":"manual","then":"The toast and its Undo button are no longer shown","when":"6 seconds pass"}],"ears":"When Alex undoes a booking from the booking toast within 5 seconds, the booking service shall delete the Booked record as if it was never made, without creating a Cancelled record or late flag, and restore the session's booked count to its value before the booking.","id":"REQ-25","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","Q-3"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Booked record on a 45-minute session that started 46 minutes ago","id":"AC-26.1","level":"unit","then":"The returned record status value is Attended and it is in the returned Past list, not the Upcoming list","when":"The bookings are read"},{"given":"A Booked record on a 45-minute session that started 44 minutes ago","id":"AC-26.2","level":"unit","then":"The returned record status value is Booked","when":"The bookings are read"}],"ears":"When the end time (start plus duration) of a session with a Booked record of Alex's has passed, the booking service shall return that record with status Attended in the Past list.","id":"REQ-26","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","Q-8","ASM-4"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Stored data where Alex is Booked on a future session whose status is \"Cancelled by studio\"","id":"AC-27.1","level":"unit","then":"The returned Past list contains that record with status value \"Cancelled by studio\" and the Upcoming list does not","when":"The bookings are read"}],"ears":"If a session for which Alex holds a Booked or Waitlisted record has status \"Cancelled by studio\", then the booking service shall return that record in the Past list with status \"Cancelled by studio\".","id":"REQ-27","op":"ADDED","sources":["ASM-19","ASM-8"],"stability":0.3333333333333333},{"acceptance":[{"given":"The clock is Tue 13 Oct 2026 09:00 and Alex is Booked today 18:00, Waitlisted tomorrow 07:00 and Booked Thu 15 Oct 12:00","id":"AC-28.1","level":"unit","then":"The returned groups are \"Today\", \"Tomorrow\", \"Thu 15 Oct\" in that order, each holding the matching record","when":"The Upcoming list is read"},{"given":"Alex has Attended records from 3, 5 and 10 days ago and a late Cancelled record from 1 day ago","id":"AC-28.2","level":"unit","then":"The returned list order is 1, 3, 5, 10 days ago and the cancelled record has late flag value true","when":"The Past list is read"},{"given":"Alex is Booked for a 45-minute class starting at 18:00 today","id":"AC-28.3","level":"unit","then":"The returned Upcoming list still contains the record with status Booked","when":"The bookings are read with the clock at 18:30"}],"ears":"The booking service shall return Alex's Upcoming list as Booked and Waitlisted records for sessions that have not ended, ordered by start time ascending and grouped under \"Today\", \"Tomorrow\" or a \"Thu 15 Oct\" style label, and the Past list as Attended and Cancelled records ordered most recent first.","id":"REQ-28","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-3"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Alex has 2 upcoming Booked and 1 Waitlisted records","id":"AC-30.1","level":"unit","then":"The returned Upcoming value is 2","when":"getStats() is called"},{"given":"The clock is 20 Oct 2026, Alex has 3 Attended records in October, 1 in September and 2 late-cancelled records in October","id":"AC-30.2","level":"unit","then":"The returned Classes this month value is 3","when":"getStats() is called"},{"given":"The clock is Wednesday in week W and Alex has Attended records in weeks W, W-1 and W-2 and none in W-3","id":"AC-30.3","level":"unit","then":"The returned Current streak value is 3","when":"getStats() is called"},{"given":"Attended records in the previous week and the week before, none in the week before that and none yet this week","id":"AC-30.4","level":"unit","then":"The returned Current streak value is 2","when":"getStats() is called"}],"ears":"When My Bookings stats are requested, the booking service shall return Upcoming as the count of upcoming Booked records, Classes this month as the count of Attended records in the current Europe/London calendar month, and Current streak as the number of consecutive Monday–Sunday weeks with at least one Attended record counting back from the current week (or from the previous week if the current week has none yet), with late cancellations changing no stat.","id":"REQ-30","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","Q-7","ASM-11"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A bookable session with 5 spots left","id":"AC-31.1","level":"unit","then":"The returned value is Book with spots-left value 5","when":"getActionState(session) is called"},{"given":"A full session with waitlist count 4 and no record for Alex","id":"AC-31.2","level":"unit","then":"The returned value is Join waitlist with position value 5","when":"getActionState(session) is called"},{"given":"Sessions that have started, have status \"Cancelled by studio\", and start in 8 days","id":"AC-31.3","level":"unit","then":"Each returned value is Disabled with a non-empty reason text that differs per case","when":"getActionState is called for each"},{"given":"A session with capacity 16, booked count 15 and waitlist count 1, where Alex is Waitlisted at position 1 with a stored overlap reason","id":"AC-31.4","level":"unit","then":"The returned value is Waitlisted with position value 1 and the stored reason, not Book","when":"getActionState(session) is called"}],"ears":"When the action state for a session is requested, the booking service shall return one of Book (with spots left), Join waitlist (with the position Alex would get), Booked, Waitlisted (with position and any stored skip reason, whenever Alex holds a Waitlisted record, even if the session has free spots), or Disabled with a reason text for started, past, studio-cancelled or outside-booking-window sessions.","id":"REQ-31","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-3","I-4","ASM-14"],"stability":0.3333333333333333},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Sessions with capacity 20 and booked counts 12, 18, 19 and 20 (waitlist 4)","id":"AC-32.1","level":"unit","then":"The returned values are \"8 spots left\", \"Only 2 left\", \"1 spot left\" and \"Full · 4 on waitlist\"","when":"availabilityLabel is called for each"},{"given":"A session with status \"Cancelled by studio\"","id":"AC-32.2","level":"unit","then":"The returned value is \"Cancelled\"","when":"availabilityLabel is called"}],"ears":"When a session's availability label is requested, the booking app shall return \"Cancelled\" for a studio-cancelled session, \"Full · N on waitlist\" for a full session, \"1 spot left\" for one free spot, \"Only N left\" for 2–3 free spots, and \"N spots left\" for 4 or more free spots.","id":"REQ-32","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-3"],"stability":0.6666666666666666},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Sessions with 8 free spots, 2 free spots, 1 free spot, full with 4 waitlisted, and Cancelled by studio","id":"AC-33.1","level":"manual","then":"The labels shown are \"8 spots left\", \"Only 2 left\", \"1 spot left\", \"Full · 4 on waitlist\" and \"Cancelled\"","when":"A person views their cards"},{"given":"\"Sunrise Vinyasa\" has 20 spots and 18 booked","id":"AC-33.2","level":"manual","then":"The card shows \"Booked ✓\" and the availability label displayed is \"1 spot left\"","when":"Book is activated on its card"}],"ears":"The Schedule screen shall display on each class card the availability label defined by REQ-32, so one free spot reads \"1 spot left\" and 2–3 free spots read \"Only N left\".","id":"REQ-33","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-3","Q-10"],"stability":0.3333333333333333},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A day with sessions at 07:00 Yoga Low, 11:59 HIIT High, 12:00 Yoga Medium, 17:00 Yoga High and 18:30 Spin High","id":"AC-34.1","level":"unit","then":"The returned list contains only the 17:00 Yoga session","when":"filterSessions is called with types [Yoga] and time [Evening]"},{"given":"The same day","id":"AC-34.2","level":"unit","then":"The returned list is the 17:00 Yoga and 18:30 Spin sessions in that order","when":"filterSessions is called with types [Yoga, Spin] and intensity [High]"},{"given":"A day with Yoga at 07:00, HIIT at 12:00, Yoga at 16:59 and Spin at 17:00","id":"AC-34.3","level":"unit","then":"The returned list is the 12:00 HIIT and 16:59 Yoga sessions","when":"The schedule is requested with time-of-day filter [Afternoon] and type filter [HIIT, Yoga]"},{"given":"A day with Yoga 07:00, HIIT 12:00, Spin 17:00 and a Cancelled by studio Boxing 19:00","id":"AC-34.4","level":"unit","then":"The returned list is Yoga 07:00, HIIT 12:00, Spin 17:00, Boxing 19:00 with the Boxing status value Cancelled by studio","when":"The schedule is requested for that day with no filters"}],"ears":"When schedule filters are applied, the booking service shall return the selected day's sessions, including sessions Cancelled by studio, ordered by start time, that match any selected class type, any selected intensity and any selected time of day (Morning before 12:00, Afternoon 12:00–16:59, Evening 17:00 onward), where an empty filter group matches everything.","id":"REQ-34","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-3","ASM-10"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Today is Wednesday 7 October","id":"AC-35.1","level":"manual","then":"The day strip shows chips \"Mon 5\" to \"Sun 11\" with \"Wed 7\" highlighted and selected, and the previous-week arrow is shown disabled","when":"The Schedule screen opens"},{"given":"The current week is shown","id":"AC-35.2","level":"manual","then":"Chips \"Mon 12\" to \"Sun 18\" are shown and the next-week arrow is shown disabled","when":"The next-week arrow is activated"}],"ears":"The Schedule screen shall show a Monday–Sunday day strip of 7 chips labelled like \"Mon 12\", with today highlighted, days without sessions dimmed, and previous/next week arrows limited to the current and next week.","id":"REQ-35","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-3","ASM-9","ASM-20"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A selected day with sessions of several types","id":"AC-36.1","level":"manual","then":"Only Yoga cards are shown, ordered by start time","when":"The Yoga chip is selected"},{"given":"Yoga and Evening filters are selected on the Schedule screen","id":"AC-36.2","level":"manual","then":"No filter chip is shown as selected and the list shows every session for the day","when":"\"Clear filters\" is activated"}],"ears":"The Schedule screen shall show a filter bar with multi-select class type chips in each type's accent colour, Low/Medium/High intensity chips, Morning/Afternoon/Evening chips and a \"Clear filters\" action that resets all filters.","id":"REQ-36","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-3"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A selected day with a Yoga session and a studio-cancelled session","id":"AC-37.1","level":"manual","then":"The Yoga card displays time, duration, name, \"Yoga\" tag, intensity, instructor avatar and name, room and a capacity bar, and the studio-cancelled card's name is shown struck through with the label \"Cancelled\" and a disabled button","when":"The Schedule screen is shown"}],"ears":"The Schedule screen shall show each session of the selected day as a card displaying start time and duration, class name, colour-coded type tag with text, intensity indicator, instructor avatar and name, room, capacity bar with availability label, and an action button, with studio-cancelled sessions shown struck through.","id":"REQ-37","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-3","I-4"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A selected day with a bookable, a full, a Booked and a Waitlisted (#2) session","id":"AC-38.1","level":"manual","then":"The card buttons are displayed as \"Book\", \"Join waitlist\", \"Booked ✓\" and \"Waitlisted #2\"","when":"The Schedule screen is shown"},{"given":"A session that started 5 minutes ago and a session starting in 8 days","id":"AC-38.2","level":"manual","then":"Both cards show a disabled action button","when":"The Schedule screen is displayed for their days"},{"given":"\"Power HIIT\" is full with 2 on the waitlist","id":"AC-38.3","level":"manual","then":"The button is shown as \"Waitlisted #3\"","when":"Join waitlist is activated on its card"}],"ears":"The Schedule screen shall label each card's action button \"Book\", \"Join waitlist\", \"Booked ✓\" or \"Waitlisted #N\" according to Alex's state, or show it disabled when the session has started, is cancelled by the studio, or is outside the booking window.","id":"REQ-38","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-4"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Schedule card","id":"AC-39.1","level":"manual","then":"The Class Detail screen for that session is shown and no booking record is created","when":"The card is activated outside its button"},{"given":"A My Bookings row","id":"AC-39.2","level":"manual","then":"The Class Detail screen for that session is shown","when":"The row is activated"}],"ears":"When Alex activates a Schedule class card outside its action button or a My Bookings row, the booking app shall open the Class Detail screen for that session.","id":"REQ-39","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"\"Sunrise Vinyasa\" on Monday 07:00 has 20 spots and 18 booked","id":"AC-40.1","level":"manual","then":"The card shows \"Booked ✓\", the toast message \"You're booked for Sunrise Vinyasa · Mon 07:00\" is displayed with an Undo button, and the class is listed under Upcoming in My Bookings","when":"Book is activated on its card"},{"given":"The booking toast is shown","id":"AC-40.2","level":"manual","then":"The card shows \"Book\" with its previous availability label again and no row for that class is sho