e the screen to its previous state and show an error toast with a plain-language message and no raw error text or stack trace.","id":"REQ-42","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-4","I-6"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A selected day with no sessions","id":"AC-43.1","level":"manual","then":"The message \"No classes on this day\" is displayed with an icon","when":"The Schedule screen shows that day"},{"given":"A day with only Yoga sessions","id":"AC-43.2","level":"manual","then":"The message \"No classes match your filters\" and a Clear filters button are displayed","when":"Only the Boxing chip is selected"},{"given":"Reading stored data fails","id":"AC-43.3","level":"manual","then":"An inline error message with a Retry button is displayed and no raw error text or stack trace is shown","when":"The Schedule screen loads"}],"ears":"While schedule data is loading, empty, filtered to nothing, or failed to load, the Schedule screen shall show skeleton cards, \"No classes on this day\" with an icon, \"No classes match your filters\" with Clear filters, or an inline error message with Retry, respectively.","id":"REQ-43","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-3"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Schedule shows next week's Thursday with the Yoga filter selected","id":"AC-44.1","level":"manual","then":"The Schedule screen is shown with next week's Thursday selected and the Yoga chip shown as selected","when":"A card is opened and Back is activated on Class Detail"},{"given":"My Bookings shows the Past tab","id":"AC-44.2","level":"manual","then":"The My Bookings screen is shown with the Past tab selected","when":"A row is opened and Back is activated on Class Detail"}],"ears":"When Back is used on Class Detail, the booking app shall return to the screen it was opened from (Schedule or My Bookings) with that screen's selected day, week, filters and tab kept.","id":"REQ-44","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","Q-1"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Yoga session 07:00, 60 minutes, Studio A","id":"AC-45.1","level":"manual","then":"The page displays a sage-green hero with the class name, \"Yoga\" tag and intensity, the date, \"07:00–08:00\", \"60 min\", \"Studio A\", the instructor name and bio, the description, the what-to-bring items, the availability block and the text \"Free cancellation until 2 hours before class.\"","when":"Its Class Detail screen is opened"},{"given":"A Pilates class","id":"AC-45.2","level":"manual","then":"The hero is displayed in the Pilates dusty rose accent","when":"Its Class Detail screen is opened"}],"ears":"The Class Detail screen shall show a hero header in the class type's accent colour with class name, type tag and intensity, plus date, start–end time, duration, room, an instructor card with avatar, name and bio, the description, a \"What to bring\" list with icons, an availability block with capacity bar and spots-left or waitlist count, and the text \"Free cancellation until 2 hours before class.\"","id":"REQ-45","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-3","I-7"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A session with 5 spots left where Alex is not booked","id":"AC-46.1","level":"manual","then":"The footer displays a \"Book this class\" button and the text \"5 spots left\"","when":"Class Detail is opened"},{"given":"A full session with waitlist count 2 where Alex is not booked","id":"AC-46.2","level":"manual","then":"The footer displays \"Join waitlist\" and \"You'd be #3\"","when":"Class Detail is opened"},{"given":"Sessions where Alex is Booked and where Alex is Waitlisted #2","id":"AC-46.3","level":"manual","then":"The footers display \"Cancel booking\" with \"You're booked\" and \"Leave waitlist\" with \"You're #2 on the waitlist\" respectively","when":"Each Class Detail is opened"},{"given":"A session with status \"Cancelled by studio\" and a session starting 8 days from now","id":"AC-46.4","level":"manual","then":"The footer button is shown disabled with reason text \"Cancelled by studio\" and with reason text about the 7-day booking window respectively","when":"Each Class Detail is opened"},{"given":"A 375 px wide viewport on a Class Detail screen","id":"AC-46.5","level":"manual","then":"The footer action button is shown inside the viewport at each position","when":"The page is scrolled to the top, middle and bottom"}],"ears":"The Class Detail action footer shall show \"Book this class\" with \"X spots left\", \"Join waitlist\" with \"You'd be #N\", \"Cancel booking\" in destructive style with \"You're booked\", \"Leave waitlist\" with \"You're #N on the waitlist\", or a disabled button with the reason text for started, past, studio-cancelled or outside-booking-window sessions, and stay pinned to the bottom of the viewport at every scroll position on viewports under 768 px.","id":"REQ-46","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-3","I-4","I-10","ASM-1"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Booked session starting in 90 minutes","id":"AC-47.1","level":"manual","then":"A dialog is shown containing the text \"Late cancellation — this counts as a missed class.\" in warning style","when":"Cancel booking is activated"},{"given":"A Booked session starting in 3 hours","id":"AC-47.2","level":"manual","then":"The dialog was shown without the late-cancellation text, the footer still shows \"Cancel booking\" and My Bookings still shows the record as Booked","when":"Cancel booking is activated and the dialog is dismissed"},{"given":"An upcoming Booked row in My Bookings for a session starting in 90 minutes","id":"AC-47.3","level":"manual","then":"The same confirmation dialog is shown with the late-cancellation text","when":"Its quick Cancel action is activated"}],"ears":"When Alex chooses to cancel a booking from Class Detail or the My Bookings quick Cancel action, the booking app shall open a confirmation dialog before cancelling that, for a session starting in less than 2 hours, shows the warning \"Late cancellation — this counts as a missed class.\" in warning style.","id":"REQ-47","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-3","I-4","ASM-3"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Class Detail shows \"Book this class\" and the session becomes full in stored data","id":"AC-48.1","level":"manual","then":"The availability block shows the full state and the footer button shows \"Join waitlist\" with \"You'd be #N\"","when":"\"Book this class\" is activated"},{"given":"A session that overlaps Alex's Booked \"Power HIIT\" 18:00–18:45","id":"AC-48.2","level":"manual","then":"The error message \"You're already booked for Power HIIT at 18:00–18:45.\" is displayed","when":"\"Book this class\" is activated"}],"ears":"If a booking from Class Detail is rejected, then the booking app shall show the rule's message (such as the overlap message naming the conflicting class or the 10-class limit message), and also refresh the availability block and change the footer to \"Join waitlist\" when the rejection reason is that the session became full.","id":"REQ-48","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-3","I-4"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Fresh seed data with today Wednesday 7 October","id":"AC-49.1","level":"manual","then":"2 rows with \"Booked\" badges and 1 row with a \"Waitlisted #N\" badge are displayed in start-time order under day headings such as \"Today\", \"Tomorrow\" and \"Fri 9 Oct\", each with a Cancel or Leave button, and the Upcoming stat tile shows 2","when":"The My Bookings Upcoming tab is shown"},{"given":"Alex late-cancelled a class","id":"AC-49.2","level":"manual","then":"That row is displayed with the badge \"Late cancel\" and the stat tile values match the values returned by getStats","when":"The Past tab is shown"},{"given":"An upcoming Booked row starting in more than 2 hours","id":"AC-49.3","level":"manual","then":"The row is shown in the Past tab with a \"Cancelled\" badge","when":"Its Cancel action is activated and confirmed"}],"ears":"The My Bookings screen shall show a header with the AR avatar, \"Alex Rivera\" and \"Unlimited Monthly\", three stat tiles (Upcoming, Classes this month, Current streak (weeks)), and Upcoming and Past tabs, where Upcoming rows are grouped by day and show time, class name, type tag, instructor, room, a \"Booked\" or \"Waitlisted #N\" badge and a Cancel or Leave action, and Past rows show a status badge reading \"Attended\", \"Cancelled\", \"Late cancel\" or \"Cancelled by studio\".","id":"REQ-49","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-3","Q-7","ASM-3","ASM-19"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Alex has no Booked or Waitlisted upcoming records","id":"AC-50.1","level":"manual","then":"The text \"No upcoming classes\" was displayed and the Schedule screen is now shown","when":"\"Browse schedule\" on the Upcoming tab is activated"},{"given":"Alex has no past records","id":"AC-50.2","level":"manual","then":"The text \"Your class history will appear here.\" is displayed","when":"The Past tab is shown"}],"ears":"While Alex has no upcoming records, no past records, or My Bookings is loading or failed to load, the My Bookings screen shall show \"No upcoming classes\" with a \"Browse schedule\" button that opens Schedule, \"Your class history will appear here.\", skeleton rows, or an inline error with Retry, respectively.","id":"REQ-50","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"The built app with the OS in light mode","id":"AC-51.1","level":"manual","then":"The reviewer records that all colour values come from named tokens, the page background is shown warm off-white, each class type uses its listed accent on its tag, card edge and detail hero, and the look is boutique rather than an admin template","when":"A reviewer inspects the stylesheet and the three screens at 375 px and 1280 px"}],"ears":"The booking app shall define its colours as design tokens with a warm off-white background, near-black text, one brand primary for primary actions, semantic success, warning, danger and muted colours, and accents Yoga sage green, Pilates dusty rose, HIIT coral/orange, Spin electric blue and Boxing deep plum used on tags, card edges and the detail hero.","id":"REQ-51","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-7"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"The OS set to dark mode","id":"AC-52.1","level":"manual","then":"Each screen is shown with a dark background and no light-background panels, and every text/background pair measured by an automated contrast checker reports a ratio value of at least 4.5:1 for body text","when":"Each of the three screens is opened"}],"ears":"Where the system colour preference is dark, the booking app shall render all three screens in a dark theme.","id":"REQ-52","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-7"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"The Schedule list","id":"AC-53.1","level":"manual","then":"Digits are displayed aligned vertically and the computed font-variant-numeric value is tabular-nums","when":"A reviewer compares start times of consecutive cards"}],"ears":"The booking app shall use one display font for headings and class names, one sans-serif body font, a type scale with display, h1, h2, body and caption sizes, and tabular figures for times and numbers.","id":"REQ-53","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-7"],"stability":0.6666666666666666},{"acceptance":[{"given":"The OS reduced-motion setting is on","id":"AC-54.1","level":"manual","then":"The panel and toast are displayed with no slide animation and the capacity bar is displayed without a fill animation","when":"A reviewer opens Class Detail and books a class"}],"ears":"While the system prefers reduced motion, the booking app shall replace card press, panel slide, capacity bar fill and toast slide animations with instant changes.","id":"REQ-54","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-7"],"stability":0.6666666666666666},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A keyboard-only user","id":"AC-55.1","level":"manual","then":"Every step is completed without a pointer and a focus outline is shown on each focused control","when":"They open Schedule, filter by Yoga, book a class, open My Bookings and cancel it"}],"ears":"The booking app shall make every interactive element reachable and operable by keyboard alone with a visible focus indicator.","id":"REQ-55","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-8"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A session with capacity 20 and 14 booked","id":"AC-56.1","level":"manual","then":"The value read is \"6 of 20 spots left\"","when":"Its capacity bar's accessible name is read by an accessibility tree inspector"},{"given":"A screen reader (VoiceOver or NVDA) is running","id":"AC-56.2","level":"manual","then":"The announced value for the capacity bar is \"6 of 20 spots left\" and the type tag is announced by name","when":"A person navigates to a card for that session"}],"ears":"The booking app shall use semantic headings, landmarks and labels, announce the capacity bar as \"N of M spots left\", and pair every colour signal (type tags, status badges) with text or an icon.","id":"REQ-56","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-8"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"The cancel confirmation dialog is open","id":"AC-57.1","level":"manual","then":"Focus stays on dialog controls during tabbing, and after Escape the dialog is no longer shown, focus is on the Cancel booking button and the booking is still shown as Booked","when":"Tab is pressed repeatedly and then Escape"}],"ears":"While a dialog is open, the booking app shall keep keyboard focus inside the dialog and close it when Escape is pressed, returning focus to the control that opened it.","id":"REQ-57","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-8"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Viewports of 360 px and 375 px wide","id":"AC-58.1","level":"manual","then":"The page's scroll width value equals the viewport width (only the day strip scrolls horizontally)","when":"Each of the three screens is opened"},{"given":"Viewports of 768 px and 800 px wide","id":"AC-58.2","level":"manual","then":"Class cards are shown in 2 columns","when":"The Schedule screen is displayed"},{"given":"A 1280 px wide viewport","id":"AC-58.3","level":"manual","then":"Class Detail is shown as a side panel while the schedule list stays displayed","when":"A class card is activated"}],"ears":"The booking app shall render all three screens without horizontal page scrolling from 360 px wide (only the day strip may scroll), show schedule cards in 2 columns from 768 px to 1023 px, and from 1024 px show Class Detail as a side panel beside the schedule within a maximum content width.","id":"REQ-58","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-10","ASM-1","Q-10"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A 360 px wide viewport","id":"AC-59.1","level":"manual","then":"Each measured width and height value is at least 44 px","when":"The bounding box of every button, chip and link is measured"}],"ears":"The booking app shall make every interactive target at least 44 × 44 px.","id":"REQ-59","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-8","I-10"],"stability":0.6666666666666666},{"acceptance":[{"given":"The repository with dependencies installed","id":"AC-60.1","level":"job","then":"The exit status is 0 and the test report lists at least one passing test for each of the 8 named business rules with a failed count of 0","when":"The unit test job is run in CI"}],"ears":"When the project's automated test job runs, the test suite shall run passing tests that call the booking service directly for booking success, full-class rejection with waitlist join, waitlist promotion, the 7-day and 15-minute windows, the late-cancellation flag, overlap rejection, the 10-booking limit, and past and studio-cancelled rejection.","id":"REQ-60","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","I-4"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"The built app","id":"AC-61.1","level":"job","then":"The exit status is 0 and the report shows the schedule → Yoga filter → book → My Bookings → cancel test passed","when":"The end-to-end test command runs in CI"}],"ears":"The project shall include an automated end-to-end test that opens the Schedule, filters by Yoga, books a class, finds it in My Bookings and cancels it.","id":"REQ-61","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Local storage holds data seeded on Wednesday 2026-10-07 (weeks starting 5 Oct and 12 Oct)","id":"AC-62.1","level":"unit","then":"The returned session list contains at least 20 sessions starting between Monday 2026-10-19 and Sunday 2026-10-25 covering all 5 types, the sessions of 12–18 Oct keep their stored IDs, start times and count values, and Alex's returned booking records are identical to the stored records","when":"The booking service is initialised with a clock of Wednesday 2026-10-14 10:00 Europe/London"},{"given":"Local storage holds data seeded on 2026-10-07","id":"AC-62.2","level":"unit","then":"The returned session list contains at least 40 sessions starting between Monday 2026-11-02 and Sunday 2026-11-15, and a book call on one of them that starts within 7 days and has free spots returns a Booked record","when":"The booking service is initialised with a clock of Wednesday 2026-11-04 10:00 Europe/London"},{"given":"The booking service was initialised over that storage with a clock of 2026-10-14","id":"AC-62.3","level":"unit","then":"The returned session count value is the same as after the first initialisation (no duplicate sessions)","when":"A new instance is initialised over the same storage with the same clock"}],"ears":"When the app loads with stored data whose sessions do not cover the current or the next Monday–Sunday week in Europe/London, the booking service shall generate seed sessions for each missing week, covering all 5 class types, without adding any booking record for Alex, add them to local storage, and keep every stored session, booking record and session count unchanged.","id":"REQ-62","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","I-6","Q-6","ASM-5"],"stability":0.3333333333333333},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Booked record on a session starting in 3 hours with booked count 10 and waitlist count 2","id":"AC-63.1","level":"unit","then":"The second call returns an \"invalid booking state\" error, the record status value is Cancelled, the waitlist count value is 1 and the booked count value is 10 (reduced only once)","when":"cancel(booking) is called twice in a row with no wait between them"},{"given":"Alex is Waitlisted at position 2 on a full session with waitlist count 3 starting tomorrow","id":"AC-63.2","level":"unit","then":"The returned error is \"invalid booking state\", the record status value stays Waitlisted with position value 2, and the waitlist count value stays 3","when":"cancel(booking) is called with that Waitlisted record"},{"given":"Alex holds an Attended record and a Cancelled record on past sessions","id":"AC-63.3","level":"unit","then":"Each call returns an \"invalid booking state\" error and each record's status value is unchanged","when":"cancel is called for each record"},{"given":"Alex holds a Booked record on a session starting tomorrow with booked count 12","id":"AC-63.4","level":"unit","then":"The returned error is \"invalid booking state\", the record status value stays Booked and the booked count value stays 12","when":"leaveWaitlist(booking) is called with that Booked record"},{"given":"Alex is Waitlisted at position 3 on a session with waitlist count 3 starting tomorrow","id":"AC-63.5","level":"unit","then":"The second call returns an \"invalid booking state\" error and the waitlist count value is 2","when":"leaveWaitlist(booking) is called twice in a row"}],"ears":"If Alex requests to cancel a record whose status is not Booked, or to leave a waitlist with a record whose status is not Waitlisted, then the booking service shall reject the request with an \"invalid booking state\" error and leave every booking record and session count unchanged.","id":"REQ-63","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-4"],"stability":0.3333333333333333}],"roundTrip":{"droppedSpans":[],"inventedCapabilities":["There is a single pre-signed-in member, Alex Rivera, with no sign-in screen.","A top bar must show the Pu